{"id":"perf_590373cf2b915f33","title":"节奏狂欢——苏州交响乐团音乐会","city":"苏州","venue":"苏州文化艺术中心","hall":"金鸡湖音乐厅","startTime":"2027-06-05T11:30:00.000Z","weekday":"周六","dateLabel":"06/05","timeLabel":"19:30","description":"本场音乐会汇聚二十世纪最具生命力的舞蹈音乐杰作，以节奏为脉搏，以色彩为语言，呈现跨越欧洲与拉丁美洲的炽烈风情。法雅《三角帽》第二组曲洋溢安达卢西亚民间神韵；伯恩斯坦《西区故事》交响舞曲融汇爵士、拉丁与百老汇语汇，迸发都市活力；拉威尔《波莱罗舞曲》以恒定节奏与层层递进的配器，铸就音乐史上最具张力的渐进篇章；吉纳斯特拉《南美大牧场》则以奔放粗犷的民族节奏，为音乐会注入原始而炽热的生命激情。四部作品交相辉映，展现舞蹈音乐跨越地域与文化的恒久魅力。","status":"scheduled","ticketUrl":"https://sscac.maitix.com/h5?code=003e5MFa1SBzcM0qf7Ia11lXco3e5MFD&state=154b6a7e32bde544195712ec00058f3e#/pages-order/projectDetail/index?projectId=238906067","sourceName":"苏州交响乐团官网","sourceUrl":"https://www.szsorch.com/2026-27-Music-Season/2088144657307222016.html","scrapedAt":"2026-08-27T12:09:09.581Z","ensemble":"苏州交响乐团","conductor":"李飚","performers":["李飚"],"composers":["法雅","伯恩斯坦","拉威尔","吉纳斯特拉"],"program":[{"composer":"法雅","title":"三角帽第二组曲","confidence":"official","id":"program_4073fd7826d6024d","workId":"work_a14315d171656023"},{"composer":"伯恩斯坦","title":"交响舞曲选自《西区故事》","confidence":"official","id":"program_52ddadef8af931de","workId":"work_125ed2916ea3d74c"},{"composer":"拉威尔","title":"波莱罗舞曲","confidence":"official","id":"program_d7498d49a9b05ea6","workId":"work_a274246b0c4c6859","knowledgeWorkId":"work_000022","knowledgeMapping":{"ruleId":"mapping_ravel_bolero","method":"reviewed-exact","reviewedAt":"2026-08-08T00:00:00.000Z"}},{"composer":"吉纳斯特拉","title":"芭蕾舞剧《南美大牧场》","confidence":"official","id":"program_456993b4f6a811a3","workId":"work_002df25c633fa780"}],"tags":["法雅","伯恩斯坦","拉威尔","吉纳斯特拉","交响","音乐会"],"dataQuality":"scraped","projectId":"event_89509dfdd64ebd02","priceTiers":[],"sources":[{"sourceId":"suzhou-symphony-official","sourceName":"苏州交响乐团官网","sourceRecordId":"szsorch_2088144657307222016_1812195000000","sourceUrl":"https://www.szsorch.com/2026-27-Music-Season/2088144657307222016.html","ticketUrl":"https://sscac.maitix.com/h5?code=003e5MFa1SBzcM0qf7Ia11lXco3e5MFD&state=154b6a7e32bde544195712ec